    enrolled: 186, enrolledBasis: "randomised", enrolledNote: "The Archives of Drug Information 2011 abstract reports 95 patients randomised to epoetin theta and 91 to placebo (186 in total), and the ISRCTN08063129 record gives a target enrolment of 186; the study has no ClinicalTrials.gov record, so there is no NCT enrolment figure to compare.",
